    {
      "id": "section:0/block:43/seg:0",
      "source": "If you plan to track your machine learning experiments, you can set up Weights & Biases alongside Hugging Face:",
      "source_hash": 16104599214245465306,
      "context_hash": 11922224585902605306,
      "translation": "머신러닝 실험을 추적할 계획이라면 Hugging Face와 함께 Weights & Biases를 설정할 수 있습니다:",
