        "Hugging Face": "Hugging Face",
        "machine learning": "머신러닝"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-17T13:28:40.725596Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:45/seg:0",
      "source": "You can get your W&B API key from <https://wandb.ai/settings> and your Hugging Face token from <https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens> .",
